WEBVTT

00:38:28.965 --> 00:38:30.776
And sure enough there is some research

00:38:30.800 --> 00:38:32.800
by Stéphane Côté and his colleagues,

00:38:32.824 --> 00:38:35.035
showing that the most dangerous colleagues

00:38:35.059 --> 00:38:37.465
are emotionally intelligent takers,

00:38:37.489 --> 00:38:40.695
because they're very good
at manipulating you for their own gain,

00:38:40.719 --> 00:38:43.103
but convincing you
that it's for your benefit,

00:38:43.127 --> 00:38:46.444
and maybe to your point
they've even convinced themselves

00:38:46.468 --> 00:38:48.652
it is for your benefit.

00:38:49.769 --> 00:38:54.250
DF: Yeah, it's really easy for folks
of that profile to fake empathy.

00:38:55.384 --> 00:39:00.271
Because they can
intellectually understand,